{"id":"u54","kelas":"kerja","no":7,"judul":"Rapat","title":"Meetings","emoji":"🗣️","ringkas":"Agenda, berpendapat, menyela dengan sopan, dan notulen","ready":true,"goals":["memahami alur rapat: **agenda**, pembukaan, pembahasan, **action items**, dan penutupan","membuka dan menutup rapat dengan ungkapan yang tepat","meminta dan memberi pendapat, setuju, dan tidak setuju secara profesional","menyela, meminta klarifikasi, dan merangkum dengan sopan","membagi tugas dan menyepakati **tindak lanjut**","membaca dan menulis **notulen** (minutes) sederhana"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Rapat yang baik **terarah, singkat, dan menghasilkan keputusan**. Rapat yang buruk membuang waktu. Di unit ini kamu belajar ungkapan untuk ikut serta dalam rapat, dari membuka sampai membagi tugas, serta cara menulis notulen."},{"t":"grammar","title":"1. Alur rapat","table":[["Tahap","Fungsi","Contoh"],["**Opening**","membuka dan menyambut","[[Let's get started.]] / [[Thank you all for coming.]]"],["**Agenda**","menyebut topik","[[Today we will discuss three items.]]"],["**Discussion**","membahas","[[Let's move on to the next point.]]"],["**Decision**","memutuskan","[[So, we've agreed to ...]]"],["**Action items**","pembagian tugas","[[Dina, could you prepare the report by Friday?]]"],["**Closing**","menutup","[[That's all for today. Thank you.]]"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"2. Berpendapat, setuju, dan tidak setuju","table":[["Fungsi","Ungkapan"],["Meminta pendapat","[[What do you think about ...?]] / [[Does anyone have any comments?]] / [[What's your view on ...?]]"],["Berpendapat","[[In my opinion, ...]] / [[I think we should ...]] / [[From my point of view, ...]]"],["Setuju","[[I agree with you.]] / [[That's a good point.]] / [[Exactly.]]"],["Setuju sebagian","[[I see what you mean, but ...]] / [[You have a point, however ...]]"],["Tidak setuju (sopan)","[[I'm afraid I see it differently.]] / [[I understand, but I'm not sure that ...]]"],["Mengusulkan","[[How about ...?]] / [[Why don't we ...?]] / [[I suggest we ...]]"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"3. Menyela, klarifikasi, dan merangkum","table":[["Fungsi","Ungkapan"],["Menyela sopan","[[Sorry to interrupt, but ...]] / [[Can I just add something?]]"],["Mempersilakan","[[Please go ahead.]] / [[Let him finish first.]]"],["Klarifikasi","[[Could you clarify what you mean by ...?]] / [[Do you mean that ...?]]"],["Mengulang","[[Just to confirm, you're saying that ...]]"],["Merangkum","[[To sum up, ...]] / [[So, in summary, ...]]"],["Mengembalikan fokus","[[Let's get back to the agenda.]]"]]},{"t":"vocab","title":"4. Kosakata penting","items":[{"en":"agenda","id":"agenda","ex":"The agenda has three items."},{"en":"minutes","id":"notulen","ex":"Dina will take the minutes."},{"en":"chair","id":"memimpin rapat / ketua","ex":"Mr. Adi will chair the meeting."},{"en":"attendee","id":"peserta","ex":"There are ten attendees."},{"en":"apologies","id":"permohonan maaf tidak hadir","ex":"Apologies from Tom, who is ill."},{"en":"proposal","id":"usulan","ex":"I have a proposal."},{"en":"motion","id":"mosi / usulan resmi","ex":"The motion was approved."},{"en":"approve","id":"menyetujui","ex":"The team approved the budget."},{"en":"postpone","id":"menunda","ex":"Let's postpone this item."},{"en":"action item","id":"butir tindakan","ex":"There are two action items."},{"en":"deadline","id":"tenggat","ex":"The deadline is Friday."},{"en":"follow-up","id":"tindak lanjut","ex":"We need a follow-up meeting."},{"en":"issue","id":"masalah / isu","ex":"Let's discuss the main issue."},{"en":"budget","id":"anggaran","ex":"The budget is limited."},{"en":"consensus","id":"kesepakatan bersama","ex":"We reached a consensus."}]},{"t":"grammar","title":"5. Membuat keputusan dan membagi tugas","table":[["Fungsi","Ungkapan"],["Memutuskan","[[So, it's decided: we will ...]] / [[We've agreed to ...]]"],["Menugaskan","[[Could you take care of ...?]] / [[Dina, you will be responsible for ...]]"],["Menyanggupi","[[I'll take care of it.]] / [[I can do that by Friday.]]"],["Menunda","[[Let's table this until next week.]]"],["Menetapkan tindak lanjut","[[Let's meet again on Monday to review progress.]]"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"6. Notulen (minutes)","table":[["Bagian","Contoh"],["Judul","[[Minutes of the Sales Meeting – 5 May 2026]]"],["Peserta","[[Present: Mr. Adi, Ms. Sari, Dina, Tom]] / [[Apologies: Budi]]"],["Pembahasan","[[It was agreed that the launch will be postponed.]]"],["Keputusan","[[The budget was approved.]]"],["Tindakan","[[Action: Dina to send the report by Friday.]]"],["Pertemuan berikut","[[Next meeting: 12 May at 10 a.m.]]"]]},{"t":"tip","title":"Bahasa notulen","text":"Notulen memakai **simple past** dan **passive voice**: [[It was agreed that ...]], [[The budget was approved.]], [[Tom was asked to ...]]. Ditulis dari sudut pandang orang ketiga, singkat, dan faktual."},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog 1: Membuka rapat","lines":[{"who":"Mr. Adi","en":"Good morning, everyone. Thank you all for coming. Let's get started.","id":"Selamat pagi semuanya. Terima kasih sudah hadir. Mari kita mulai."},{"who":"Mr. Adi","en":"Today we have three items on the agenda: the sales report, the new budget, and the launch date.","id":"Hari ini ada tiga butir agenda: laporan penjualan, anggaran baru, dan tanggal peluncuran."},{"who":"Mr. Adi","en":"Dina will take the minutes. Tom sends his apologies; he is ill today.","id":"Dina akan mencatat notulen. Tom menyampaikan permohonan maaf; ia sakit hari ini."},{"who":"Ms. Sari","en":"Shall we begin with the sales report?","id":"Bagaimana kalau kita mulai dengan laporan penjualan?"}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog 2: Berdiskusi","lines":[{"who":"Mr. Adi","en":"What do you think about moving the launch to June?","id":"Bagaimana pendapat kalian tentang memindahkan peluncuran ke bulan Juni?"},{"who":"Ms. Sari","en":"In my opinion, it's a good idea. We need more time to test the product.","id":"Menurut saya itu ide bagus. Kita butuh waktu lebih untuk menguji produk."},{"who":"Dina","en":"I see what you mean, but the customers are waiting. How about a smaller launch in May?","id":"Saya paham maksud Ibu, tetapi pelanggan sedang menunggu. Bagaimana kalau peluncuran kecil di bulan Mei?"},{"who":"Mr. Adi","en":"That's a good point. Sorry to interrupt, Dina, but could you clarify what you mean by a smaller launch?","id":"Itu poin bagus. Maaf menyela, Dina, tetapi bisakah kamu menjelaskan maksud peluncuran kecil?"},{"who":"Dina","en":"A launch for 100 selected customers first. We can fix any problems before the full launch.","id":"Peluncuran untuk 100 pelanggan terpilih dulu. Kita bisa memperbaiki masalah sebelum peluncuran penuh."}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog 3: Menutup rapat","lines":[{"who":"Mr. Adi","en":"To sum up, we agreed on a smaller launch in May and a full launch in June.","id":"Singkatnya, kita sepakat peluncuran kecil di bulan Mei dan peluncuran penuh di bulan Juni."},{"who":"Mr. Adi","en":"Dina, could you prepare the customer list by Friday?","id":"Dina, bisakah kamu menyiapkan daftar pelanggan sebelum Jumat?"},{"who":"Dina","en":"Yes, I'll take care of it.","id":"Ya, saya akan mengurusnya."},{"who":"Mr. Adi","en":"Good. That's all for today. Thank you, everyone.","id":"Bagus. Itu saja untuk hari ini. Terima kasih semuanya."}]},{"t":"summary","items":["Alur: **opening → agenda → discussion → decision → action items → closing**.","Pendapat: [[In my opinion, ...]]; setuju sebagian: [[I see what you mean, but ...]].","Menyela: [[Sorry to interrupt, but ...]]; merangkum: [[To sum up, ...]].","Tugas: [[Could you take care of ...?]] / [[I'll take care of it.]]","Notulen: simple past dan passive ([[It was agreed that ...]])."]}],"practice":[{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kosakata dengan artinya:","pairs":[["agenda","daftar acara rapat"],["minutes","notulen"],["attendee","peserta"],["proposal","usulan"],["consensus","kesepakatan bersama"]],"exp":"Kosakata rapat.","k":"23c25c8e"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan tahap rapat dengan ungkapannya:","pairs":[["opening","Let's get started."],["discussion","Let's move on to the next point."],["decision","We've agreed to ..."],["closing","That's all for today."]],"exp":"Tahap rapat.","k":"9a508a84"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan fungsi dengan ungkapan:","pairs":[["menyela","Sorry to interrupt, but ..."],["merangkum","To sum up, ..."],["setuju","That's a good point."],["tidak setuju sopan","I'm afraid I see it differently."]],"exp":"Fungsi ungkapan.","k":"c6abc347"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Untuk membuka rapat kita berkata...","options":["Let's get started.","Let's finish.","Go home.","That's all."],"answer":0,"exp":"Membuka.","k":"45227f3c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Untuk meminta pendapat kita berkata...","options":["What do you think about this plan?","Do it.","Be quiet.","I decide."],"answer":0,"exp":"Meminta pendapat.","k":"b869c9c3"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Cara sopan menyela adalah...","options":["Sorry to interrupt, but may I add something?","Shut up.","Stop talking.","I'm speaking."],"answer":0,"exp":"Sopan.","k":"a44f627d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Cara sopan tidak setuju adalah...","options":["I see your point, but I'm not sure that works.","You're wrong.","That's stupid.","No."],"answer":0,"exp":"Sopan.","k":"e883e970"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Untuk merangkum kita berkata...","options":["To sum up, we agreed to postpone the launch.","First, hello.","By the way, hi.","Anyway, bye."],"answer":0,"exp":"To sum up.","k":"f45934d3"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Untuk menugaskan seseorang dengan sopan kita berkata...","options":["Could you take care of the report?","Do the report now.","You, report.","Report is you."],"answer":0,"exp":"Sopan.","k":"00e72b61"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Jawaban yang tepat saat menyanggupi tugas adalah...","options":["I'll take care of it.","I won't.","Not me.","Maybe never."],"answer":0,"exp":"Menyanggupi.","k":"fad0b7e9"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Siapa yang membuat notulen?","options":["orang yang ditugaskan mencatat","satpam","pelanggan","tamu"],"answer":0,"exp":"Notulis.","k":"9165da37"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Bahasa notulen biasanya memakai...","options":["simple past dan passive","perintah","pertanyaan","future perfect"],"answer":0,"exp":"It was agreed that ...","k":"5ce2ad86"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat notulen yang tepat adalah...","options":["It was agreed that the launch will be postponed.","We agree postpone launch now.","Launch no.","Please postpone!"],"answer":0,"exp":"Gaya notulen.","k":"8cba8c13"},{"type":"fill","id":"Mari kita mulai.","q":"Let's get ___.","answers":["started"],"hint":"mulai","exp":"get started.","k":"78067727"},{"type":"fill","id":"Terima kasih sudah hadir.","q":"Thank you all for ___.","answers":["coming"],"hint":"datang","exp":"for coming.","k":"67bc8484"},{"type":"fill","id":"Menurut saya itu ide bagus.","q":"In my ___, it's a good idea.","answers":["opinion"],"hint":"pendapat","exp":"In my opinion.","k":"3bb37752"},{"type":"fill","id":"Maaf menyela.","q":"Sorry to ___.","answers":["interrupt"],"hint":"menyela","exp":"interrupt.","k":"7e1611e1"},{"type":"fill","id":"Singkatnya, kita setuju.","q":"To ___ up, we agreed.","answers":["sum"],"hint":"jumlah","exp":"To sum up.","k":"0b05845d"},{"type":"fill","id":"Bisakah Anda menjelaskan maksud Anda?","q":"Could you ___ what you mean?","answers":["clarify"],"hint":"menjelaskan","exp":"clarify.","k":"5df6f694"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Mari kita lanjut ke butir berikutnya.\"","answer":"Let's move on to the next item.","exp":"move on to.","k":"61d3b726"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Dina akan mencatat notulen.\"","answer":"Dina will take the minutes.","exp":"take the minutes.","k":"6be9561c"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"Let us get back to the agenda","options":["Mari kembali ke agenda","Mari pulang","Mari makan siang","Mari mulai rapat baru"],"answer":0,"exp":"back to the agenda.","k":"5b7fcc8c"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"I see what you mean but I am not sure","options":["Saya paham maksud Anda, tetapi saya tidak yakin","Saya setuju sepenuhnya","Saya tidak melihat Anda","Saya sedang pergi"],"answer":0,"exp":"setuju sebagian.","k":"8473a11f"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"That is all for today thank you everyone","options":["Itu saja untuk hari ini, terima kasih semuanya","Mari mulai hari ini","Besok kita rapat lagi","Saya mau pulang"],"answer":0,"exp":"closing.","k":"b713f7ae"},{"type":"fill","id":"Bagaimana kalau kita tunda butir ini?","q":"How ___ we postpone this item?","answers":["about"],"hint":"bagaimana","exp":"How about ...?","k":"12c494c2"},{"type":"fill","id":"Mengapa kita tidak mulai sekarang?","q":"Why ___ we start now?","answers":["don't"],"hint":"negatif","exp":"Why don't we ...?","k":"e4eafc73"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya mengusulkan kita bertemu lagi hari Senin.","q":"I ___ we meet again on Monday.","answers":["suggest"],"hint":"mengusulkan","exp":"I suggest we ...","k":"80564b63"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dari sudut pandang saya, itu terlalu mahal.","q":"From my point of ___, it is too expensive.","answers":["view"],"hint":"pandang","exp":"point of view.","k":"85ce77cc"},{"type":"fill","id":"Anggaran telah disetujui.","q":"The budget has been ___. (approve)","answers":["approved"],"hint":"V3","exp":"has been approved.","k":"f4001fd5"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kami mencapai kesepakatan.","q":"We reached a ___.","answers":["consensus","decision","agreement"],"hint":"kesepakatan","exp":"consensus.","k":"919bef93"},{"type":"fill","id":"Silakan, lanjutkan.","q":"Please go ___.","answers":["ahead"],"hint":"ke depan","exp":"go ahead.","k":"5d14317b"},{"type":"fill","id":"Tom menyampaikan permohonan maaf tidak hadir.","q":"Tom sends his ___.","answers":["apologies"],"hint":"maaf","exp":"apologies.","k":"40deeeb9"},{"type":"fill","id":"Tolong mencatat notulen.","q":"Please take the ___.","answers":["minutes"],"hint":"notulen","exp":"take the minutes.","k":"58be84a9"},{"type":"fill","id":"Pertemuan berikutnya hari Senin.","q":"The ___ meeting is on Monday.","answers":["next"],"hint":"berikutnya","exp":"next.","k":"83f570f4"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kita perlu rapat tindak lanjut.","q":"We need a ___-up meeting.","answers":["follow"],"hint":"lanjut","exp":"follow-up.","k":"c7221fcc"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang meminta pendapat?","options":["What's your view on this?","Here is my view.","No view.","View me."],"answer":0,"exp":"Meminta pendapat.","k":"54a5d8f8"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang menyetujui?","options":["That's a good point. I agree.","That's wrong.","I hate it.","No way."],"answer":0,"exp":"Setuju.","k":"283317c1"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang setuju sebagian?","options":["I partly agree, but I have another idea.","I totally agree.","I totally disagree.","I don't care."],"answer":0,"exp":"Sebagian.","k":"ea5feec9"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang meminta klarifikasi?","options":["Do you mean that we should delay it?","We should delay it.","I delay it.","Delay!"],"answer":0,"exp":"Do you mean ...","k":"57e4b63c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang mengusulkan?","options":["Why don't we hold the meeting online?","We held the meeting.","The meeting is online.","Meeting."],"answer":0,"exp":"Why don't we ...","k":"19d6e427"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang tepat untuk menunda pembahasan?","options":["Let's table this until next week.","Never talk about this.","Delete this.","Stop meeting."],"answer":0,"exp":"Table = tunda.","k":"69b60ee7"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang notulen yang baik?","options":["The team agreed to approve the new budget.","We hate budget lol.","Budget budget.","Who cares."],"answer":0,"exp":"Faktual.","k":"94305eff"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang tepat setelah seseorang selesai bicara?","options":["Thank you, Tom. Does anyone have any questions?","Next.","Shut up.","Whatever."],"answer":0,"exp":"Sopan.","k":"a71116c4"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang tepat untuk memastikan pemahaman?","options":["Just to confirm, you're saying we should wait?","I know.","Wait.","You wait."],"answer":0,"exp":"Konfirmasi.","k":"97fab70b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata \"approve\" artinya...","options":["menyetujui","menolak","menunda","menyalin"],"answer":0,"exp":"approve.","k":"c8a47bbd"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata \"chair\" dalam rapat berarti...","options":["memimpin rapat","duduk saja","pergi","makan"],"answer":0,"exp":"chair a meeting.","k":"61f25333"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata \"attendee\" artinya...","options":["peserta","pemilik","penjaga","penjual"],"answer":0,"exp":"attendee.","k":"f0345f95"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat \"It was agreed that the launch will be delayed\" termasuk gaya...","options":["notulen","undangan","iklan","cerita"],"answer":0,"exp":"Notulen.","k":"3e66187d"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Maaf menyela, tetapi saya ingin menambahkan sesuatu.\"","answer":"Sorry to interrupt, but I would like to add something.","exp":"Sorry to interrupt, but ...","k":"859f6e3a"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kata dengan artinya:","pairs":[["budget","anggaran"],["issue","masalah"],["follow-up","tindak lanjut"],["deadline","tenggat"]],"exp":"Kosakata rapat.","k":"aa8fb65c"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"Does anyone have any comments","options":["Apakah ada yang punya komentar","Siapa yang tidak hadir","Kapan rapat selesai","Saya punya komentar"],"answer":0,"exp":"comments.","k":"ffd6311d"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"I will take care of it","options":["Saya akan mengurusnya","Saya lupa","Saya tidak mau","Saya baru tiba"],"answer":0,"exp":"take care of.","k":"b0541f1c"},{"type":"fill","id":"Mari kita mulai rapatnya.","q":"Let's get the meeting ___.","answers":["started","going"],"hint":"mulai","exp":"started.","k":"17a2bba5"},{"type":"fill","id":"Agenda hari ini ada tiga poin.","q":"There are three ___ on today's agenda.","answers":["items","points"],"hint":"poin","exp":"items.","k":"787b2d6d"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya akan mencatat notulen.","q":"I will take the ___.","answers":["minutes"],"hint